Read this actual situation under the supplied sense. Enumerate who must do what, the record created or consumed, the authority needed and the observable completion condition. Preserve exceptions and prerequisites. If context cannot determine a consequence, return that uncertainty explicitly instead of inventing a procedure. Do not copy the desired mapping conclusion into this independent reading.
